      <p class="presse-chapo">
        For a news outlet, the keyboard is not a technical detail: it is the tool that produces every headline,
        every quote and every article.
      </p>

      <div class="presse-grille presse-grille--angles">
        <article class="presse-carte">
          <h3>The everyday keyboard</h3>
          <p>Traditional Windows AZERTY is still the majority layout, even though it makes É, Ç, À, œ and French quotation marks harder to type.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="presse-carte">
          <h3>A gentle transition</h3>
          <p>The letters A to Z stay in place, and AZERTY Global requires no new hardware.</p>
        </article>
